          <h1 class="rp-h1 rv d2">GEO vs SEO: What Actually Changed, and What Still Works</h1>
          <p class="rp-lead rv d3">The difference between GEO and SEO is where you show up: SEO ranks your pages in Google's list of links, and GEO gets your brand named and cited inside AI answers from ChatGPT, Gemini, Perplexity and Google's AI Overviews. Most of the groundwork is shared, but what counts as a win, and how you measure it, is not.</p>
          <div class="rp-meta rv d4">
